    <region left="0" top="1125" width="773" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="773" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-weight: bold;">The peak impedance of your new tank must be at least 80% of the original. Use the same modelling method for both. Report their loaded Q and bandwidth, and explain the difference. You do not have to obtain the same bandwidth.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
