        <content>
          <p>I would order these parts for the prototype after confirming that the new tank’s peak impedance is at least 80% of the original design’s peak impedance using the same modelling method. The simulated nominal resonance of 5.649 GHz is within the required band. The quoted stock of both components is sufficient for 1,000 circuits.</p>
